%description:
Tests TcpSocket::setMaxSeg(), the socket option TCP_MAXSEG. The mss parameter
is 1000. The client application sets TCP_MAXSEG to 600 before its open (t=0.2),
so the SYN announces an MSS of 600 and the data segments carry 600 bytes. At
t=2 it sets 400 on the open connection, and the later segments carry 400 bytes.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.tOpen=0.5s
*.cli_app.maxSegScript="0.2 600; 2 400"
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1200; 3.0 1200"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.503 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.505 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 125501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 125001:125601(600) ack 125501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 125601 win 16384 
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 125601:126201(600) ack 125501 win 16384 
[1.407 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 126201 win 16384 
[3.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 126201:126601(400) ack 125501 win 16384 
[3.203 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 126601 win 16384 
[3.205 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 126601:127001(400) ack 125501 win 16384 
[3.205 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 127001:127401(400) ack 125501 win 16384 
[3.407 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 127401 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Tcp Header Option MSS(=600) sent
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
TCP_MAXSEG: SMSS is set to 400
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
